\ A quotation-local redefinition whose declared effect mismatches the shadowed word's arity must
\ raise arity-mismatch under eager compilation, where it previously ran to completion because the
\ compiled body materialized the literal without its declaration. Pinned eager in both suites via
\ the flags sidecar; the compiled rendering lacks the interpreter's error frames, so the golden
\ cannot be shared with an interpreted run. The interpreted twin is
\ local_redef_arity_mismatch_interp.1z.

val: ( -- s ) [ "A" ] ;

make-stored: ( -- s ) [
  val: ( x y -- s ) [ 2drop "B" ] ;
  val
] ;

make-stored drop
